# NOITE's prison escape (3farmcai) starts the real SERIAL, in the Corrigida, and nobody plays it: the intro
# screen waits for a key, the killers take the five lives at 123400 ms, a key takes the end screen down, the
# result is a loss, and NOITE takes a life and says so in the prison.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 3farmcai --ms 132000 --fix all --input tools/play/serial-corrigida-3farmcai-lose.input [--dump DIR]
#
# SERIAL starts at 3210 ms (the epoch's seed 3, as serial-3farmcai-win); its timers wait for the key at
# 5000 ms, so `tools/serial_bot.py --seed 3 --arm 5000 --passive` is the game: the killers' shots at 13400,
# 43400, 73400, 83400 and 123400.
